# The correctness gate. Mirrors CI minus the format check (pre-commit already formatted).
#
# Turborepo caches aggressively, so an unchanged repo returns in seconds. Deliberately does
# NOT run `next build` — that is CI's job, and adding ~40s to every push is how teams start
# reaching for --no-verify.
#
# Escape hatch when genuinely needed: git push --no-verify
npm run typecheck
npm run test
npm run depcruise
